{"id":"d3ac68eea8338476","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-consistcond.md","title":"Boolean-equation consistency criterion","display":"thm-consistcond — Boolean-equation consistency criterion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-consistcond","aliases":["27-thm-consistcond"],"display":"thm-consistcond — Boolean-equation consistency criterion","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]","[[27-df-consistent]]","[[27-df-constfunc]]"],"local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-consistcond"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-consistcond</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-consistcond — Boolean-equation consistency criterion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c18697a66efe44c\" href=\"?note=3c18697a66efe44c\" title=\"27-df-consistent\">27-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35eab4f22873ea23\" href=\"?note=35eab4f22873ea23\" title=\"27-df-constfunc\">27-df-constfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> (Boolean function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}\\)</span> (equation-consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3c18697a66efe44c\" href=\"?note=3c18697a66efe44c\" title=\"27-df-consistent\">27-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_n\">\\(\\mathbf1_n\\)</span> (constant-one function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35eab4f22873ea23\" href=\"?note=35eab4f22873ea23\" title=\"27-df-constfunc\">27-df-constfunc</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}(f)\\leftrightarrow f\\neq\\mathbf1_n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}(f)\\leftrightarrow f\\neq\\mathbf1_n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the zero-set convention for Boolean equations; satisfiability uses the one-set convention.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"3c18697a66efe44c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-constfunc","status":"resolved","id":"35eab4f22873ea23","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-constfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ (Boolean function, see [[27-df-boolfunc]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"3c18697a66efe44c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}$ (equation-consistency predicate, see [[27-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-constfunc","status":"resolved","id":"35eab4f22873ea23","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf1_n$ (constant-one function, see [[27-df-constfunc]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}(f)\\leftrightarrow f\\neq\\mathbf1_n)","display":true}],"bytes":953,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-393","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-consistcond|thm-consistcond — Boolean-equation consistency criterion]]"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817","3c18697a66efe44c","35eab4f22873ea23"]}